      "description": "Linked month tile carrying the level fill; current month gets the inset ultramarine ring.",
      "html": "<ol class=\"ds-cal\"><li data-level=\"available\"><a href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-cal-name\">окт</span><svg class=\"ds-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6.5\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-cal-level\">В сезон</span></a></li><li data-level=\"peak\"><a href=\"#\" aria-current=\"date\"><span class=\"ds-cal-name\">ное</span><svg class=\"ds-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polygon fill=\"currentColor\" points=\"8,0.8 10.2,5.7 15.5,6.2 11.5,9.7 12.7,14.9 8,12.2 3.3,14.9 4.5,9.7 0.5,6.2 5.8,5.7\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-cal-level\">Разгар</span></a></li><li data-level=\"storage\"><a href=\"#\"><span class=\"ds-cal-name\">дек</span><svg class=\"ds-mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"8\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M8 2a6 6 0 0 0 0 12z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg><span class=\"ds-cal-level\">От хранилище</span></a></li></ol>",
      "css": ".ds-cal{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;font-family:var(--font-family-base)}.ds-cal a{display:grid;justify-items:center;gap:var(--space-1);min-height:2.75rem;padding:var(--space-2) var(--space-1);color:var(--color-text-muted);background:var(--color-surface);text-align:center;text-decoration:none}.ds-cal [data-level=peak] a{color:var(--color-on-peak);background:var(--color-peak)}.ds-cal [data-level=available] a{color:var(--color-on-badge);background:var(--color-available)}.ds-cal [data-level=storage] a{color:var(--color-on-badge);background:var(--color-storage)}.ds-cal a[aria-current=date]{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 2px var(--color-background),inset 0 0 0 5px var(--color-accent);font-weight:700}.ds-cal a:focus-visible{outline:var(--focus-width) solid var(--color-focus);outline-offset:2px}.ds-cal-name{font-weight:600;text-decoration:underline}.ds-cal-level{font-size:var(--font-size-sm);line-height:1.2}.ds-mark{width:1em;height:1em}"
    }
